---

<div class="home-container">
  <div class="mnheader">
    <h1 title="新大陆见闻录" class="clickable" data-home-toggle>
      《新大陆见闻录》<img src="/images/title.png" alt="新大陆见闻录" class="no-zoom" />
      <span class="view-details"></span>
    </h1>
    <div class="desc clickable" data-home-desc data-home-toggle>
      <p>
        由于《最终幻想14》游戏内容繁多，新人上手也不够友好，新人经常面临不知道做什么好的迷茫。<br
        />本站<strong>《新大陆见闻录》</strong
        >希望能给刚进入《最终幻想14》国服的玩家提供入门级别的攻略指引，帮助新玩家更好地游玩这个游戏。
      </p>
      <p>
        新大陆见闻录提供完整的手机布局，确保各位玩家能通过手机、平板访问本站的所有内容。用电脑访问时，工具栏右上角会显示二维码按钮
        <i class="ui icon qrcode"></i>
        ，鼠标悬浮即可显示当前页面二维码，扫码即可在手机上打开当前页面。
      </p>
      <p>
        你可以通过<mark class="hide-small">左侧侧边栏</mark><mark class="hide-large"
          >点击左下角绿色按钮</mark
        >查看本站的目录。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tab-container">
    {
      tabs.map((tab) => (
        <div class="mntab">
          <h2>{tab.title}</h2>
          <ul>
            {tab.links.map(([href, text]) => (
              <li>
                <a href={href}>{text}</a>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      ))
    }
    <div class="mntab"></div>
    <div class="mntab"></div>
    <div class="mntab">
      <h2>常用综合网站</h2>
      <ul>
        {
          links.map(([href, text]) => (
            <li>
              <a href={href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                {text}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  const desc = document.querySelector('[data-home-desc]')
  for (const el of document.querySelectorAll('[data-home-toggle]')) {
    el.addEventListener('click', () => desc?.classList.toggle('show'))
  }
</script>

<style lang="scss">
$c: linear-gradient(
  90deg,
  rgba(51, 43, 20, 0.8) 0%,
  rgba(229, 196, 92, 0.8) 50%,
  rgba(51, 43, 20, 0.8) 100%
);
.tab-container {
  display: flex;
  align-content: stretch;
  flex-flow: column wrap;
  height: 1015px;
  &::before,
  &::after {
    content: '';
    flex-basis: 100%;
    width: 0;
    order: 2;
  }
}
.mnheader {
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  position: relative;
  align-items: center;
  h1 {
    flex: auto;
    font-size: 0;
    img {
      background-image: url('/images/bg.png');
      background-size: contain;
    }
  }
  .desc {
    padding-left: 30px;
    font-size: 0.8em;
    color: #666;
  }
}
.mntab {
  flex: 0 1 auto;
  width: 32%;
  margin: 10px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 10px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 10px #66666630;
  background-color: white;
  transition: all 0.3s;
  &:nth-child(3n + 1) {
    order: 1;
  }
  &:nth-child(3n + 2) {
    order: 2;
  }
  &:nth-child(3n + 3) {
    order: 3;
  }
  &:hover,
  &:active {
    box-shadow:
      0px 0px 30px 10px rgba(102, 87, 41, 0.65),
      0px 0px 5px 2px rgba(191, 163, 76, 0.85);
    background-color: #ffffffe6;
  }
  h2 {
    padding: 10px 20px;
    margin: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(0deg, #72727210, #72727200);
    color: #33333e;
  }
  ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0 !important;
    margin: 0;
  }
  li {
    position: relative;
    a {
      display: block;
      position: relative;
      color: #5b480f;
      font-size: 1em;
      padding: 5px 20px;
      z-index: 40;
      transition: all 0.3s;
      &::after {
        content: ' ';
        display: block;
        position: absolute;
        left: 20%;
        top: 0;
        width: 0;
        height: 2.15em;
        background-image: $c;
        z-index: -1;
        transition: all 0.3s;
      }
      &:hover {
        color: white;
        &::after {
          left: 0;
          width: 100%;
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
@media screen and (max-width: 960px) {
  .clickable {
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .mnheader {
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    z-index: 50;
    .view-details {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      background: gray url('/images/details.svg') center no-repeat;
      background-size: 70%;
      border-radius: 100%;
      position: absolute;
      right: 0;
      top: -10px;
    }
    h1 {
      width: 100%;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .desc {
      position: absolute;
      padding: 5px;
      background: #efefef;
      border: 2px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 4px;
      transition: all 0.5s;
      opacity: 0;
      z-index: -1;
      transform: translateY(-80px);
      top: -250px;
      &.show {
        opacity: 1;
        z-index: 1;
        transform: translateY(250px);
      }
    }
  }
  .tab-container {
    align-content: center;
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
    height: auto;
  }
  .mntab {
    width: auto;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    &:nth-child(n) {
      order: 1;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 1em;
    }
    li a {
      font-size: 1em;
      padding: 5px 10px;
    }
  }
}
:global([data-theme='dark']) {
  .mnheader h1 img {
    background-image: url('/images/bgdk.png');
  }
  .mntab {
    background-color: #1c191680;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px #00000059;
    &:hover,
    &:active {
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px #cdbb5b59;
      background-color: #1c1916;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #d9cec1;
      background: linear-gradient(0deg, #72727233, #72727200);
    }
    li a {
      color: #e5c45ccc;
      &:hover {
        color: white;
      }
    }
  }
}
</style>
